  "card": "This pull request hardens legacy-to-descriptor wallet migration against mid-process crashes and filesystem permission errors. It stages new SQLite databases in temporary directories before removing original BerkeleyDB files and wraps migration in exception handlers to ensure post-failure cleanup. Without this, migration failures could leave users with partially migrated databases requiring manual recovery from backups. It touches wallet storage logic and currently needs a rebase.",
